# nvim-config

Personal VS Code–like Neovim setup. Entry points: `AGENTS.md`, then `init.lua`.

- Keep plugin specs and keymaps in `init.lua`. New Source Control logic stays in `lua/source_control.lua`.
- Sidebar title is the project folder name, not "Explorer".
- Do not give the file tree Ctrl+B; it is `<leader>e`.
- After adding a plugin, update `lazy-lock.json` via Lazy sync.
- Do not add Co-authored-by or agent attribution on commits.
- Install docs for humans are `README.md`. Do not rewrite them unless asked.
